        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I spent eleven years formulating for other people. Most of those products were designed for a stable European climate and sold here without anyone asking what a Chennai summer does to a serum.</p><p>EMBRAE began because I was tired of explaining privately why something I had worked on would stop working by its third month on an Indian shelf. Starting again was easier than continuing to apologize.</p><p>We print every percentage because I know exactly how convenient it is not to.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button": {
          "type": "button",
