        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Actives lose potency the moment they are blended. So we make in batches of two hundred, print the blend date on every box, and do not warehouse stock. What arrives is weeks old, not quarters.</p><p>Botanicals are cold-pressed and sourced from named growers. Every active is listed at its actual concentration on the carton, not hidden inside a proprietary blend.</p>",
